<title>USA: Ameriwood Industries Q1 net up after gain.</title>
<headline>Ameriwood Industries Q1 net up after gain.</headline>
<dateline>GRAND RAPIDS, Mich. 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.02		    $0.02</p>
<p> Net			  4,364			 66</p>
<p> Revs			24,980		   27,913</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   4,297		    4,197</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name is Ameriwood Industries International Corp.</p>
<p>1997 Q1 net and shr include one-time litigation gain of $4.7 million, or $1.11/shr. Excluding the gain, company would have posted a net loss of $378,000, or $0.09/shr.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
